  triage:title "FakeHerdrProcessAdapter::prompt names its used text parameter _text" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-herdr/src/lib.rs: the C2 trait-implementation update on FakeHerdrProcessAdapter::prompt introduced a parameter named _text (Rust's intentionally-unused convention) that the body immediately uses (_text.to_owned()) to populate FakeHerdrCall::Prompt; clippy pedantic used_underscore_binding flags this and it misleads readers. Introduced by the AX.2 diff. Fix: rename to text." ;
